    {
      "id": "QihmxTdfYieh-n-ARLYhL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2494.2074747171755,
      "y": 4654.225930712182,
      "width": 2042.1693140500925,
      "height": 1769.5768090433955,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#343a40",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bDi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 513658234,
      "version": 3260,
      "versionNonce": 1657124421,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776343469904,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 - Criar uma instancia de SQL no Azure\n    * Criar o banco de dados AdaProject\n    * Criar uma tabela chamada Produto\n      com os campos:\n        + Id: Int\n        + Nome: Varchar(100)\n\n2 - Criar um Function App na linguagem que\n    quiser:\n    * Python, Java, C#, Typescript (JavaScript)\n    * Com 5 endpoints\n        * GetAll - GET - products\n        * GetById - GET - products/{id}\n        * Create - POST - products + body(json)\n        * Update - PUT - products/{id} + body(json)\n        * Delete - DELETE - products/{id}\n\n3 - Publicar a Function App\n\n4 - Acesso publico.",
      "fontSize": 70.78307236173583,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1 - Criar uma instancia de SQL no Azure\n    * Criar o banco de dados AdaProject\n    * Criar uma tabela chamada Produto\n      com os campos:\n        + Id: Int\n        + Nome: Varchar(100)\n\n2 - Criar um Function App na linguagem que\n    quiser:\n    * Python, Java, C#, Typescript (JavaScript)\n    * Com 5 endpoints\n        * GetAll - GET - products\n        * GetById - GET - products/{id}\n        * Create - POST - products + body(json)\n        * Update - PUT - products/{id} + body(json)\n        * Delete - DELETE - products/{id}\n\n3 - Publicar a Function App\n\n4 - Acesso publico.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
